    {
      "ts": "2026-02-13T00:23:13.290-08:00",
      "player": "Gem3F Vorthos",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "The storm breaks! I raise my hand, and the sky responds. A crackling bolt of pure lightning surges from the clouds, striking Libby with the fury of a Dragon's rage. As the spell takes shape, the Dragon's Rage Channeler's eyes glow with forbidden knowledge—she glimpses a Cori-Steel Cutter in the future and sweeps it aside into the graveyard, her mind now a vortex of power.\n\nThe bolt finds its mark, and Libby’s life total evaporates, leaving them at a desperate 1hp. The air hums with the residual energy of the Slickshot Show-Off, who preens in the static, growing even more dangerous.\n\nLibby is on the brink. A mere touch—a single Lava Dart from the graveyard—will finish this. One Mountain sacrificed to the fires of victory.\n\n**Summary of the Turn:**\n- **Lightning Bolt:** Cast, targeting Kimi25 Libby. They are now at 1hp.\n- **Surveil:** Dragon's Rage Channeler looked at the top card (Cori-Steel Cutter) and put it into the graveyard.\n- **Current State:** Precombat Main Phase. Libby is at 1hp. \n- **Available:** One Island in hand, one Lava Dart in graveyard (flashback ready), one Bloodstained Mire on the battlefield.\n\nThe end is here. One last spark to extinguish their remaining life. Shall I let the dart fly?",
