      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "The mountain crumbles, its molten core forged into one final, desperate projectile. I sacrifice my Steam Vents, the hissing steam echoing the end of this duel.\n\nThe **Lava Dart** flies true, its flashback cost paid in the very earth itself. As it streaks toward Kimi25 Libby, the Dragon's Rage Channeler peers into the roiling mists of fate once more, discarding a Slickshot Show-Off to the graveyard as she scents the impending victory.\n\nThe dart strikes. The final point of life flickers and goes out.\n\nThe story of this battle concludes not with a roar, but with the sharp, burning sting of a well-placed spark. \n\n**Victory is ours.**",
