    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Gem3F Vorthos has the opponent at 4 life with Lava Dart available to flashback from the graveyard (by sacrificing a Mountain - but they don't have an untapped Mountain... wait, let me check). They have Bloodstained Mire untapped which could fetch a Mountain, but they also have Lightning Bolt in hand. Actually, looking more carefully: the opponent is at 4 life. Gem3F has Lightning Bolt in hand (3 damage) and Lava Dart in graveyard (1 damage flashback by sacrificing a Mountain). They could crack Bloodstained Mire to get a Mountain (going to 11 life), then cast Lightning Bolt (3 damage, opponent to 1), then flashback Lava Dart sacrificing the Mountain (1 damage, opponent to 0) for lethal. Both Steam Vents are tapped, but Bloodstained Mire is untapped - they can fetch an untapped Mountain, use it for Lightning Bolt, then sacrifice it for Lava Dart flashback. That's exactly 4 damage for lethal. They declined to activate Bloodstained Mire here, missing the kill.",
      "actionTaken": "Declined to activate Bloodstained Mire and passed, missing lethal damage.",
      "betterLine": "Crack Bloodstained Mire to fetch an untapped Mountain (pay 1 life to 11), cast Lightning Bolt targeting opponent (3 damage, opponent to 1), then flashback Lava Dart by sacrificing the Mountain (1 damage, opponent to 0) for exact lethal.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshotIndex": 48,
      "player": "Gem3F Vorthos",
      "decisionIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Gem3F Vorthos has the opponent at 4 life with Lava Dart available to flashback from the graveyard (sacrificing a Mountain - Steam Vents counts as a Mountain). They also have Lightning Bolt in hand but no untapped mana. However, Lava Dart flashback only costs sacrificing a Mountain, no mana needed. Lava Dart deals 1 damage, bringing opponent to 3. Then they could also crack Bloodstained Mire (paying 1 life) to enable revolt or get a land, but more importantly they have Lightning Bolt in hand for next turn. But wait - the opponent is at 4 life. Lava Dart flashback (1 damage) + Lightning Bolt (3 damage) = exactly 4 damage = lethal. They can flashback Lava Dart right now (sacrifice Steam Vents) for 1 damage, putting opponent to 3. Then next turn they need one red mana for Lightning Bolt. They have one untapped Bloodstained Mire which can fetch a Mountain. But they could also just crack Bloodstained Mire now, get a Mountain untapped, then cast Lightning Bolt (3 damage) putting opponent to 1, then flashback Lava Dart sacrificing the other Steam Vents for the final 1 damage. That's lethal THIS TURN. Crack Bloodstained Mire -> fetch a Mountain (pay 1 life, going to 11), then cast Lightning Bolt (3 damage, opponent to 1), then flashback Lava Dart sacrificing Steam Vents (1 damage, opponent to 0). That's lethal right now and they passed the turn instead.",
      "actionTaken": "Passed the turn without acting, leaving the opponent alive at 4 life.",
      "betterLine": "Activate Bloodstained Mire to fetch a Mountain (e.g., another Steam Vents untapped), cast Lightning Bolt targeting opponent (4 -> 1), then flashback Lava Dart by sacrificing a Steam Vents dealing 1 damage (1 -> 0) for lethal damage this turn.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshotIndex": 49,
      "player": "Gem3F Vorthos",
      "decisionIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With Lightning Bolt on the stack targeting the opponent at 4 life, flashing back Lava Dart (sacrificing a Steam Vents) would deal the remaining 1 damage for guaranteed lethal. By declining, Gem3F relies on combat damage to finish the opponent at 1 life, introducing unnecessary risk from potential removal spells (the opponent could have Fatal Push or similar to remove attackers).",
      "actionTaken": "Declined to flash back Lava Dart while Lightning Bolt was on the stack",
      "betterLine": "Flash back Lava Dart targeting the opponent for 1 damage, guaranteeing lethal in combination with Lightning Bolt's 3 damage (4 total vs 4 life) with zero risk",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshotIndex": 52,
      "player": "Gem3F Vorthos",
      "decisionIndex": 90
    }
  ],
